  intro hM hM' l _ O _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ G Γ ι _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ F hOk hLV hC hVE hCl hX g₁ hm R _ _ _ u hU hfin φ Good hGood hRig
